--
-- Grain convention: an attr whose meaning is uniform wherever it appears is recorded once
-- with signal_name = '*'; an attr whose meaning differs by signal name (e.g. `type`,
-- `duration_ms`) gets one row per signal name. Resource-block attrs use signal='resource'.
-- Redaction (#8) denylist keys are recorded as denied at '*' (stripped wherever seen);
-- the content attrs (prompt/response/body/body_ref) are recorded under their bearing event.

